scope: |
  The Char-to-Int boundary fix landed in b672b0d41 and passed focused local gates, but exact-SHA
  conformance run 30286311782 exposed a JS regression in multi-parameter typed lambdas:
  entry normalization assigns to immutable `const [a, b]` bindings, causing three standard-library
  conformance cases to exit with `TypeError: Assignment to constant variable`.
next: Rebase the worktree, record the CI regression in SPRINT.md and BUGS.md, then fix immutable lambda parameter normalization and add/run a minimal conformance regression plus the three failing standard-library cases.
